Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1440
Set Height 860
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "GitHub Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type 'cd "$DEMO" && clear && shj' Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Type " G"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 300ms
Type " f"
Sleep 500ms
Type "store"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type ":21"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Screenshot diff.png
